flowchart TD
    A[GET /api/recommendations/] --> B[Return stored recommendations]
    B --> C[Tester reviews evidence, risk and manual steps]
    C --> D{Tester decision}

    D -->|Reject| E["POST /api/recommendations/{id}/reject"]
    E --> F[Set status to REJECTED]
    F --> G[(recommendations table)]
    G --> H[Return rejected recommendation]

    D -->|Approve| I["POST /api/recommendations/{id}/approve?approved_by=NAME"]
    I --> J[Set status to APPROVED and record reviewer]
    J --> G
    G --> K[Return approved recommendation]

    K --> L[Recommendation remains advisory and manually executed]
    H --> L

    M{Exact registered Metasploitable 2 lab verified?}
    M -->|No| N[No access-testing workflow is offered]
    M -->|Yes| O[Display ./ptas.sh access-test command]
    O --> P[Re-verify VM identity, isolation, target and scan fingerprint]
    P --> Q[Require separate explicit confirmation]
    Q --> R[Show one manual lab exercise]

    NOTE[Approval does not automatically execute an attack<br/>or store screenshots and evidence]
    NOTE -.-> L
